        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI Satin Stainless Steel Double Cylinder Deadbolt </b>\r\n<p>\r\nSatin stainless steel finished Double Cylinder Deadbolt (keyed on both the outside and inside). These high security deadbolts will fit doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Great for standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-single-cylinder-deadbolt-ahi-4650\"><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for AHI Satin Stainless Steel Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>6 Pin Schlage C Keyway for Security</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core for Extra Security</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI 4660 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
